<title>PARAGUAY: SOCCER-ARGENTINA BEAT PARAGUAY IN QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINA BEAT PARAGUAY IN QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina beat Paraguay 2-1</p>
<p>(halftime 2-0) in a South American World Cup qualifier on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Paraguay - Roberto Acuna (58, penalty)</p>
<p>Argentina - Marcelo Gallardo (30), Juan Veron (41)</p>
</text>
